  "sourceTitle": "Ripe Tomato Pickle",
  "sourceText": "Ripe Tomato Pickle\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 16, 2009 - 11:15pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 pints tomatoes, peeled and chopped\n4 tablespoons salt\n6 tablespoons sugar\n1 cup chopped celery\n6 tablespoons mustard seed\n4 tablespoons chopped red pepper\n1/2 teaspoon clove\n1/2 teaspoon cinnamon\n4 tablespoons chopped onion\n1 teaspoon grated nutmeg\n2 cups vinegar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix ingredients in order given. Put in a stone jar and cover. This uncooked mixture must stand a week before using, but may be kept a year.",
